# Owner paths and rule paths of this project (Vatra S3). A pull request that changes one of these files needs the
# owner's review as code owner; the ruleset on main enforces it and a GitHub App cannot bypass it.
# Sources: owner_paths in plis-toolkit factory/registry.json, policy.protected in .factory/config.json, the
# project rule paths in plis-toolkit factory/rule_paths.json, and PROTECTED_ALWAYS in factory.py.
# Patterns follow gitignore rules: a leading / anchors at the root, a trailing / covers the whole directory,
# ** covers any depth. Where the factory's fnmatch `*` also crosses `/`, the pattern here is widened to match.
# When the registry's owner_paths or policy.protected change, this file changes in the same pull request.

